  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fresh Horizons: Cold Chain Solutions for Fisheries in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fresh Horizons: MSD Pilot project will test an inclusive, climate-resilient Market Systems Development (MSD) approach in the fisheries sector of Aden Governorate, Yemen. Building on the findings of the 2023 MSA, which identified critical gaps in key market functions, the project aims to enhance food security and incomes of women, men and youth in Yemen by working collaboratively with local market actors to unlock business growth. Leveraging Mercy Corps&#x2019; experience implementing successful MSD interventions in the Middle East and Africa, the pilot will demonstrate the impact of increased access to solar cold chain technology for fisheries traders.</narrative>
  </description>
